# Secrets now live in Supabase (Project Settings > Edge Functions > Secrets), not in this file.
# Set them with: supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=... BREVO_API_KEY=... BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=... GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=...
# Names used by the Edge Functions: GEMINI_API_KEY, GEMINI_MODEL (optional), BREVO_API_KEY, BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL,
# BREVO_SENDER_NAME (optional), GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY, GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID (optional).
# Turnstile: the secret key is set in Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > Attack Protection; the site key is in js/supabase-config.js.
